@startuml sequence-03b-chatbot-retrieve
' Sơ đồ sequence — Chatbot RAG (3b): Session & Retrieve (§3.3b)
' Ground-truth: chatbot-service.js:317-576 (_enrichQueryFromHistory, _retrieveProducts, rewriteQuery)

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam dpi 150
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2
skinparam sequenceGroupBorderThickness 1.5
skinparam sequenceGroupBorderColor #999999
skinparam sequenceParticipant {
  BorderColor #6C8EBF
  BackgroundColor #DAE8FC
}
skinparam sequenceActor {
  BackgroundColor #f5f5f5
  BorderColor #6C8EBF
}
skinparam noteBorderColor #6C8EBF
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #fffde7
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam noteFontSize 12
skinparam sequenceParticipantFontSize 13

participant "Backend API" as API
participant "Vector Store\n(Hybrid Search)" as VS
participant "LLM API" as LLM

note over API: Tiếp theo sau bước ③ — normalizedQuery + intent đã có

== ④  Load Session History ==

note right of API
  conversationHistory.get(sessionId) — RAM Map
  TTL 30 phút, tối đa 500 sessions, mất khi restart
end note

opt Có history và query chứa đại từ  (cái đó/nó/so sánh/cả hai)
  note right of API
    _enrichQueryFromHistory: append tên SP
    từ 1-2 assistant turns gần nhất vào query
  end note
end

== ⑤  Retrieve — Hybrid Search (R trong RAG) ==

note right of API: Strip negation phrases khỏi query trước khi search\n("không cần iPhone" → loại "iPhone" khỏi embedding)

API ->> VS : hybridSearch(enrichedQuery, limit=10)
API ->> LLM : rewriteQuery(enrichedQuery)  [timeout=8s]
note right of API: Promise.all — chạy song song

VS -->> API : initialResults  (vector cosine + keyword BM25)
LLM -->> API : rewrittenQuery  hoặc  null

alt rewrittenQuery khác normalizedQuery
  API ->> VS : hybridSearch(rewrittenQuery, limit=10)
  VS -->> API : refinedResults
  note right of API: dùng refinedResults nếu > 0, fallback initialResults
end

alt Không có sản phẩm ≥ minScore 0.45
  API ->> VS : hybridSearch(finalQuery, limit=3, minScore=0)
  VS -->> API : lowConfidenceResults  (lowConfidence=true)
end

note right of API
  Hybrid scoring: vector cosine + keyword overlap boost
  Sort giảm dần → top 10 → products[]
end note

note over API: products[] (max 10) + finalQuery → bước ⑥⑦

@enduml
